7143	    /// held an `InboundSignal`, producing a two-resource request. The scheduler
7144	    /// daemon then panicked and the container hung — on a guest containing no
7145	    /// `waitid` at all, because `{InboundSignal}` is exactly what `signal_guest`
7146	    /// installs for an ordinary cross-thread signal.
